4
00:00:06,238 --> 00:00:07,384
Ia melihat panas.

5
00:00:07,404 --> 00:00:09,069
Tim SAR gabungan mencari dua

6
00:00:09,089 --> 00:00:10,540
pendaki muda yang tak ada

7
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:12,087
kabar sejak 2 November.

8
00:00:12,107 --> 00:00:14,069
Pencarian dimulai 7 November.

9
00:00:14,089 --> 00:00:15,230
Di hari ketiga,

10
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,531
106 personel dibagi enam regu.

11
00:00:17,551 --> 00:00:19,110
Satu regu menerbangkan drone

12
00:00:19,130 --> 00:00:19,657
termal.

13
00:00:19,677 --> 00:00:20,816
Semua benda memancarkan

14
00:00:20,836 --> 00:00:22,581
inframerah, makin hangat makin

15
00:00:22,601 --> 00:00:23,154
kuat.

16
00:00:23,174 --> 00:00:24,408
Tubuh manusia memancar paling

17
00:00:24,428 --> 00:00:26,069
kuat di sekitar 9,5

18
00:00:26,089 --> 00:00:28,402
