48
00:01:10,816 --> 00:01:12,577
Operator menandai titik panas,

49
00:01:12,597 --> 00:01:13,949
mengunci koordinatnya,

50
00:01:13,969 --> 00:01:14,986
lalu tim darat datang

51
00:01:15,006 --> 00:01:15,909
memastikan.

52
00:01:15,929 --> 00:01:17,425
Drone memperluas mata,

53
00:01:17,445 --> 00:01:19,066
tapi yang memastikan tetap tim

54
00:01:19,086 --> 00:01:19,598
darat.

55
00:01:19,618 --> 00:01:20,746
Saat mendaki,

56
00:01:20,766 --> 00:01:21,976
